      "writtenOn": "2023-05-12T00:04:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If onUnlink was called first, then L38 `delete ctx` would invalidate the memory being accessed here. It wouldn\u0027t null-out the cookie. Anyway, onUnlink should always be called last.\n\nAlso - prefer \u0027CHECK_NE(ctx, nullptr)\u0027 instead, because it will give you clearer log messages.",
